# Hunted Bonebrute: menace (CR 702.110b: it can't be blocked except by two or more creatures) and its dies trigger after combat damage. Bot2's two Dogs (from the enters trigger)
# cannot block the Bonebrute one at a time (refused), but may both block it: the Bonebrute's 6 damage kills both and the Dogs' 2 damage kills it. Bot2 loses 3 life from the
# dies trigger and takes no combat damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Hunted Bonebrute
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Hunted Bonebrute.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield = Dog Token; Dog Token
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Hunted Bonebrute > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Dog Token#1 > Hunted Bonebrute)
Bot2.Block(Dog Token#1 > Hunted Bonebrute; Dog Token#2 > Hunted Bonebrute)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Hunted Bonebrute; Black Lotus
